OL,3,GNEWSAQuads used for clean-up of plastic
OL,4,Apellets stolen
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree quad bikes worth #25,000 have
OL,7,Fbeen stolen from a not-for-profit
OL,8,Forganisation which is cleaning up a
OL,9,Fbeach where millions of plastic pellets
OL,10,Fwashed up last year.
OL,12,FNurdle have been removing plastic
OL,13,Fpellets which spilled onto Camber Sands
OL,14,Fin East Sussex after an issue at a
OL,15,FSouthern Water treatment works in
OL,16,FOctober 2025.
OL,18,FThis work, recently restarted following
OL,19,Fa summer break, was aided by three quad
OL,20,Fbikes loaned to the organisation which
OL,21,Fwere stolen on Saturday night according
OL,22,Fto Nurdle founder Josh Beech.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
